{"title": "Contagion Poisoned (Condition)", "pageid": 11043, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Contagion_Poisoned_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion Poisoned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Contagion_Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Contagion Poisoned</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>.</li>\n<li>Each turn, it must succeed on a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, or the poison will advance in stage. On 3 successes, it recovers. On 3 failures, it contracts the disease corresponding to the variant of the spell <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion\" title=\"Contagion\">Contagion</a> that was cast. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned,&nbsp;Diseased\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">Poisoned</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">Diseased</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Poisoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Poisoned\">SG_Poisoned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Disease\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Disease\">SG_Disease</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>There are 3 stages to this effect. On initial application, it starts at Stage 1 and each failed saving throw advances it to the next stage. Failing a saving throw at Stage 3 removes this effect and applies the Contagion disease to the target.</li>\n<li>The duration of this effect indicates the number of successful saving throws required to recover. It starts at 3 rounds and each successful save will reduce the duration by 1 round. Failing a saving throw and advancing to the next stage does not reset this duration so the successful saves do not need to be consecutive.</li>\n<li>Each variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion\" title=\"Contagion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/20px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/40px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/20px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Contagion\" title=\"Contagion\">Contagion</a> has its own version of this condition with distinct <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack IDs</a>. This means a target can be affected by multiple distinct Contagion Poisoned conditions at the same time.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Contagion_Poisoned\">Sources of Contagion Poisoned</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion\" title=\"Contagion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion\" title=\"Contagion\">Contagion</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Blinding_Sickness\" title=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Contagion_Blinding_Sickness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Blinding_Sickness\" title=\"Contagion: Blinding Sickness\">Contagion: Blinding Sickness</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Filth_Fever\" title=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Contagion_Filth_Fever_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Filth_Fever\" title=\"Contagion: Filth Fever\">Contagion: Filth Fever</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Flesh_Rot\" title=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Contagion_Flesh_Rot_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Flesh_Rot\" title=\"Contagion: Flesh Rot\">Contagion: Flesh Rot</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagion: Mindfire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/45px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/60px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Contagion: Mindfire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp/30px-Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Contagion_Mindfire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Contagion:_Mindfire\" title=\"Contagio