Disease\">Mapped Terror: Disease</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/30px-Slay_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/45px-Slay_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/60px-Slay_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slay\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp/30px-Slay_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Slay_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slay\" title=\"Slay\">Slay</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202609\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4502/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 83366/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26325/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.040/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1196822/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   76.880      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   76.880      1 -total\n 76.10%   58.508      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 49.10%   37.746      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 36.28%   27.894     17 Template:Icon_text\n 35.68%   27.428     10 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 33.60%   25.835     10 Template:MdSAI\n 32.72%   25.158     14 Template:Icon_link\n 29.20%   22.452     42 Template:Trim\n 16.71%   12.845      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with ke